{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"EarlyPaymentDiscounts\">Early payment discounts</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"By Count Custom Customer Customers Discount EarlyPaymentDiscount EarlyPaymentDiscounts HasWhere Invoice Invoices Is Payment Sales SalesInvoice SalesInvoices To ToDate\">This screen displays sales invoices where customers have earned early payment discounts by paying within the specified discount period.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Count Custom Customer Customers Discount Invoice Invoices Is To ToDate\">When customers pay invoices early enough to qualify for the discount, they appear in this list.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Count Credit CreditNote CreditNotes Discount Edit Invoice Invoices Is NewCreditNote Notes On Select To ToDate\">To issue credit notes for the earned discounts, select the relevant invoices and click the <strong>New Credit Note</strong> button.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount Count Discount Invoice Invoices Is\">The table below shows qualifying invoices with their discount amounts:</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Customer\">Customer</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Customer\">Customer</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Column Count Custom Customer Discount EarlyPaymentDiscount Is Payment To ToDate\">The <em>Customer</em> column shows the customer who earned the early payment discount.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"SalesInvoice\">Sales Invoice</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"SalesInvoice\">Sales Invoice</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Column Count Discount Invoice Is Paid Reference Sales SalesInvoice To ToDate\">The <em>Sales Invoice</em> column displays the invoice reference that was paid early to qualify for the discount.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"BalanceDue\">Balance due</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"BalanceDue\">Balance due</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Balance BalanceDue Column Current Invoice On Rent\">The <em>Balance Due</em> column shows the current outstanding balance on the invoice.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"EarlyPaymentDiscount\">Early payment discount</span></summary><div><div class=\"my-4\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 pointer-events-none text-sm w-max\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.25rem_auto_1.25rem] bg-neutral-200 gap-[1px]\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 font-bold text-neutral-500 text-shadow px-4 py-2 border-t border-t-white\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"EarlyPaymentDiscount\">Early payment discount</span></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-100 border-t border-t-white\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div><div class=\"bg-neutral-50 border-t border-white h-2\"></div></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount By Column Count Custom Customer Discount EarlyPaymentDiscount Is Payment To ToDate\">The <em>Early Payment Discount</em> column displays the discount amount earned by the customer for paying within the discount period.</p></div></details>",
  "key": "pending-early-payment-discounts"
}
